Yes, you can integrate NVIDIA Nsight Systems directly into your CI/CD pipeline for continuous profiling. This allows you to automatically profile your application and monitor performance changes over time, helping you catch performance regressions early.

Here's a step-by-step guide on how to integrate NVIDIA Nsight Systems into a CI/CD pipeline using Jenkins as an example. The same principles can be applied to other CI/CD tools like GitHub Actions, GitLab CI, or CircleCI.

### Step-by-Step Guide

